WEBVTT

00:00:11.816 --> 00:00:13.567
(laughing)

00:00:20.741 --> 00:00:23.077
(mouthing)

00:00:27.665 --> 00:00:30.042
-MAN: Pull!
-(rowers grunting

00:00:30.126 --> 00:00:31.877
Mind your strokes there, lads.

00:00:31.961 --> 00:00:33.671
Pull!

00:00:34.922 --> 00:00:36.757
DRINIAN: The wind has left us.

00:00:36.841 --> 00:00:39.427
So how do we get to
Ramandu's Island now then?

00:00:41.429 --> 00:00:43.723
My guess is something
doesn't want us to get there.

00:00:45.683 --> 00:00:47.768
-MAN: Pull!
-(rowers grunting)

00:00:47.852 --> 00:00:49.270
All together!

00:00:49.353 --> 00:00:53.107
If I get any hungrier,
I'm going to eat that dragon!

00:00:54.609 --> 00:00:57.987
Don't worry, Eustace,
they'll have to deal with me first.

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:59.488
-(Eustace growls)
-REEPICHEEP: Oh! Careful!

00:00:59.572 --> 00:01:02.825
If we don't find land by tonight,
they may well eat that dragon.

00:01:02.908 --> 00:01:04.785
(crewmen yelling)

00:01:06.495 --> 00:01:07.997
(glass shatters)

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.582
What did we hit?

00:01:09.665 --> 00:01:11.626
(crew shouting)

00:01:13.753 --> 00:01:16.213
Eustace, that's brilliant.

00:01:18.007 --> 00:01:19.717
(Eustace grunts)

00:01:23.971 --> 00:01:25.598
Onward, ho!

00:01:25.681 --> 00:01:28.768
(cheering and applause)

00:01:47.495 --> 00:01:50.665
We can't be sure the other lords
even made it to Ramandu's Island.

00:02:02.343 --> 00:02:05.304
You got us there.
What did I tell you, Eustace?

00:02:05.388 --> 00:02:07.181
Extraordinary. (laughs)

00:02:07.265 --> 00:02:08.975
Extraordinary!

00:02:10.893 --> 00:02:13.437
(birds squawking)

00:02:20.861 --> 00:02:22.780
(creatures chittering)

00:02:33.541 --> 00:02:35.835
(chittering, chirping,
squawking continue)

00:03:01.611 --> 00:03:03.529
Mmm, food.

00:03:03.613 --> 00:03:04.822
Wait.

00:03:04.905 --> 00:03:05.906
Huh?

00:03:17.418 --> 00:03:18.586
(gasping)

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:42.318
Lord Revilian.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.783
Lord Mavramorn.

00:03:53.496 --> 00:03:54.830
Lord Argoz.

00:03:55.998 --> 00:03:57.041
(breathing faintly)

00:03:57.124 --> 00:03:58.292
(startled gasp)

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.882
He's breathing.

00:04:11.472 --> 00:04:12.682
So are they.

00:04:15.559 --> 00:04:17.019
They're under a spell.

00:04:19.021 --> 00:04:20.815
-It's the food!
-Huh?

00:04:21.857 --> 00:04:23.025
Oh!

00:04:23.109 --> 00:04:25.486
Hey, it's the stone knife.

00:04:26.404 --> 00:04:27.488
This is Aslan's table.

00:04:28.656 --> 00:04:29.907
Their swords.

00:04:39.166 --> 00:04:40.167
On the table.

00:04:49.635 --> 00:04:51.137
That's six.

00:04:52.847 --> 00:04:54.432
Still missing one.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.521
Look!

00:05:02.857 --> 00:05:04.483
(gentle whooshing)

